==Notes==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*The in-game description lists ''weapon focus'' as a prerequisite, but it is not one.
*The [[difficulty class]] of the save is 10 + ½ [[character level]] + [[strength]] [[ability modifier|modifier]].
*Immunity from [[death magic]] does not protect from this feat.
*This feat is often banned from online [[persistent world]] [[multiplayer]] servers as some consider it overpowered.